# FX, 1st press: MIX (view 9) = the selected track's Mix (K1), EQ Freq (K2), Distort (K3), EQ Gain (K4).
# FX again: the effects (view 2), its 3 pages (REVERB, DELAY, COMP), then MIX again.
# Tonic BD: Mix = sound0.0.13 (0), Dist = .14 (0), EQFreq = .15 (0), EQGain = .16 (64).
wait 300
tap FX
expect view 9
turn K1 3 80
expect sound0.0.13 3
turn K2 5 80
expect sound0.0.15 5
turn K3 2 80
expect sound0.0.14 2
turn K4 -4 80
expect sound0.0.16 60
shot fxmix_track1.png
# black key 2 = track 2: the knobs now set its own sound
tapkey b1
turn K1 1 80
shot fxmix_track2.png
# FX again: PERFORM, REVERB, DELAY, COMP (view 2), then back to MIX (view 9)
tap FX
expect view 2
tap FX
expect view 2
tap FX
expect view 2
tap FX
expect view 2
expect fxpage 3
tap FX
expect view 9
# from any other page, FX goes to MIX
tap EDIT
expect view 14
tap FX
expect view 9
# wip72: slider look + the big values rectangle
turn K1 20 80
shot fxmix_mixbox.png
wait 3000
shot fxmix_idle.png
turn K2 40 80
shot fxmix_eqbox.png
# wip101 FX bug: a 2nd cycle starts at PERFORM again (it used to land on DELAY): MIX, PERFORM, REVERB, DELAY, COMP, MIX, PERFORM
tap EDIT
tap FX
expect view 9
tap FX
expect view 2
expect fxpage 0
tap FX
expect fxpage 1
tap FX
expect fxpage 2
tap FX
expect fxpage 3
tap FX
expect view 9
tap FX
expect view 2
expect fxpage 0
shot fxmix_cycle2_perform.png
